# Test: require-message-authenticator false accepts a legacy unsigned server
# VALIDATES: the same unsigned Access-Accept the default row discards logs the
# operator in through RADIUS once the server row sets the leaf false.
# PREVENTS: the leaf being parsed but never reaching the client's check.

cmd=foreground:seq=1:exec=le test fixture plugin/aaa-radius-unsigned-accept-legacy:timeout=30s
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stderr:pattern=OK: the mock answered Access-Accept unsigned
expect=stderr:pattern=auth success.*source=radius
reject=stderr:pattern=auth success.*source=local
reject=stderr:pattern=discarding an answer without Message-Authenticator
